# PACK_SHAPE

The fixture's copy of the pack contract. It exists so the generated
pack index has something real to cite, and so a test can assert the
contract is reachable. The live contract is the one that argues; this
one only has to resolve.

Every built pack carries `PACK.md`, `guides/` and `CHECKS.md`. A domain
that cannot meet the definition of done stays a registry row and is
never described as implemented.
